   \[
   \Delta S_{\text{products}} = 2 \times \Delta S_{\text{PbO}} + 2 \times \Delta S_{\text{SO}_2} = 2 \times 66.5 + 2 \times 248.2 = 133.0 + 496.4 = 629.4 \, \text{J/K mol}
   \]

2. **Calculate the entropy of the reactants:**
   \[
   \Delta S_{\text{reactants}} = 2 \times \Delta S_{\text{PbS}} + 3 \times \Delta S_{\text{O}_2} = 2 \times 91.2 + 3 \times 205.1 = 182.4 + 615.3 = 797.7 \, \text{J/K mol}
