   \[
   \Delta S_{\text{reaction}} = \Delta S_{\text{products}} - \Delta S_{\text{reactants}} = 629.4 - 797.7 = -168.3 \, \text{J/K mol}
   \]

The entropy change of the reaction is \(\boxed{-168.3 \, \text{J/K mol}}\).
