     \[
     R_S(t) = R_S(t) \cdot R_P(t)
     \]  
   - Here, \( R_S(t) \) is the reliability of the serial part, and \( R_P(t) \) is the reliability of the parallel part.  
   - The reliability of each section is calculated as in the serial and parallel cases above.  

**Final Answer**:  
