Let $y \in \mathcal{U}$. By the definition of the quotient derivative, we have:
\[
\frac{f(y) - f(x^*)}{y - x^*} \to \nabla f(x^*)(y - x^*) \quad \text{as} \quad y \to x^*.
\]
