- \( F = 60.0 \, \text{N} \)
- \( d = 10.0 \, \text{m} \)
- \( \theta = 60.0^\circ \)

Substitute the values into the formula:

\[
W = 60.0 \, \text{N} \cdot 10.0 \, \text{m} \cdot \sin 60.0^\circ
\]

\[
